<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-10-16T22:10:00.605Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 22:10:00 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Former President Joseph Kabila has allied with the M23 rebels, creating a broader anti-government coalition that is attacking the Congolese army in North Kivu. Security personnel linked to Erik Prince were ambushed, killing a former New Zealand special forces officer and wounding former UFC fighter Tim Kennedy. The United Nations has said there is a window of opportunity for peace in the DRC. The conflict remains deadly, with 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOd1QtYS0yV2hvSXgzcHVwZzF2MFRIVjUzamZhNVZjRXB1TmczS2pHeEpjdlJQVS0tY2YxdjBQQ1JTMTJqZldSaFBOZUtZOWt2TFpNRnJPRlJjQ1lpTHp1VVJCM212b0U4TlV3RkVsNTFRaFdweV9rbWRJVE16dGl6OUJuQmZJUnRXcERsMUxKUF9pWXZSRldPQlZ0TXR1X2Q1QkU1NE9B?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxQb3J5Sk1xdnNwNXYtQnlMOVhHU1l6SDdRUjZXenFGQWxLWVN3LWV5eXdfVWdWY0xfT1B3aU9GTEw4YUlVNndBZldKR3hQNkZ1M1BaTGR2YUp2RUE2NFZZWWdQQ08td2dfbmhqYkc3YkZtdk1aTTRaazBkRGs3WjBVMWhkc2ozX2hIel9qUG16QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOaFpkb2x2YmFxYWx1UThLcnFVZ2hGd1Vib3BNMWNLM1dYcXQzVmprTzRCb1UyOUV3Wl8waW92YkNPbWVlU1JfRWhEbmQ5YmJROWhpMTlCM1hBaXY4ZWxhSG1GUHRkZzRZRlV2RlBmdnIxWXlNSG9JdG9vejFpcFdUTXlvNy1JQXlrRzFPUmd1d1ZWdGNSMExCdVF1bzcyZWx3bERzdjVqVjgwYnRuWUdJakRWVmJXR2YzdTVaaE930gG-AUFVX3lxTFBycENpLVNQbmdFN0hONWRWWW8ySlFvdXpOckZQc2gxbXphaU9mZTRsZVhWRDdzdGZqTWxRM3p4Z0VfUW1GNWd2Y2c0QlVoWUtrWlpCUWtISU16S21jdXI0NDVfX1dkVkZqVXBlQ1pBUzNsTlVGcWZBQTlVRjFkOEZXVmVtSDJGeUNUOHNmaWE3Y1h2bGNtT3VfZ3NjaVNsdlN2YzNUZDJfeE0xOXNRd2ZCUlFtY2FralNyODVXTkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/